#MOBILE
Vnum       51094
Keywords   Abbigayle language teacher~
Short      abbigayle~
Long       A beautiful lady stands here, waiting for her students.
~
Desc       This has to be one of the most beautiful women in these Realms, both inside
and out. Her eyes have a sparkle of amusement and her face an easy smile.
She knows you are admiring her, and she does not seem to mind. She is
comfortable and confident that the picture she makes is breath taking. Her
voice at last breaks the spell. Her voice is like satin, you can hardly
wait for your lessons to begin. Any reason to hear her speak the tongues
foreign to your ears.
~
Race       Human~
Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     female~
Actflags   npc sentinel scholar~
Affected   detect_invis detect_hidden sanctuary truesight~
Stats1     0 5 16 5 50 0
Stats2     1000 1 0
Stats3     1 6 3
Stats4     0 0 0 0 0
Attribs    13 13 13 13 13 13 13 0
Saves      0 0 0 0 0
Speaks     common wookiee twilek rodian hutt mon_calamari noghri gamorrean jawa adarian~
Speaking   common wookiee twilek rodian hutt mon_calamari noghri gamorrean jawa adarian~
Bodyparts  head arms~
Immune     sleep charm nonmagic magic~
#MUDPROG
Progtype  all_greet_prog~
Arglist   100~
Comlist   if ispc($n)
wink $n
if level($n) < 20
tell $n My lessons start when you reach level 20. Have fun until then.
else
tell $n I am ready to teach you, are you prepared for the lessons?
endif
grin $n
endif
~
#ENDPROG

#MUDPROG
Progtype  death_prog~
Arglist   100~
Comlist   say You know, I am really a lover, not a fighter ...
mpslay $n
mpat $n mpechoat $n But alas, killing me was a slaying offense.
mpgoto 51099
mpat 51006 mpmload 51094
~
#ENDPROG

#MUDPROG
Progtype  act_prog~
Arglist   p flees head over heels!~
Comlist   mptrans 0.$n
mpechoat $n Abbigayle says, 'You fled, so I shall spare your life!'
mpgoto 51099
mpat 51006 mpmload 51094
~
#ENDPROG

#ENDMOBILE

