#ROOM
Vnum     51024
Name     Drakken Graduation Gallery~
Sector   city~
Desc     You completed the academy course. Proceed through the graduation gallery,
receive your diploma and continue toward the docking bay.

The gallery is a transparent orbital walkway attached to Drakken Proxima
Academy. Instead of a city beneath you, the windows reveal Proxima Centauri b
below and the fierce red primary beyond the shielded glass. Structural ribs
frame the corridor while traffic lights from local shuttles move silently
beyond the glass.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    51023
Flags     isdoor~
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction up~
ToRoom    51025
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 51050 1 51024
Reset O 0 51114 1 51024
Reset D 0 51024 2 0
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51025
Name     Proxima Centauri b Orbital Dock~
Sector   city~
Desc     This docking bay projects from the academy station so that training shuttles
can approach without crossing the inhabited modules. Guidance lights, docking
clamps and service equipment line the perimeter.

Beyond the bay you can see Proxima Centauri b below and the fierce red primary
beyond the shielded glass. A small shuttle is waiting to carry graduates down
toward Proxima Centauri b. To board it, use ENTER.
~
#EXIT
Direction down~
ToRoom    51024
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction somewhere~
ToRoom    51026
Flags     hidden can_enter~
#ENDEXIT

Reset O 0 51022 1 51025
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51026
Name     Proxima Centauri b Planetfall Shuttle~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob~
Desc     You are inside a compact planetfall shuttle. Passenger seats sit directly
behind the pilot position, with a small service compartment at the rear. The
craft carries newly graduated students from Drakken Proxima Academy toward
Proxima Centauri b.

Give your diploma to the pilot when requested. If you do not yet have one, use
LEAVE and return to the graduation area.
~
#EXIT
Direction somewhere~
ToRoom    51025
Flags     hidden can_leave~
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 51055 1 51026
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51027
Name     Drakken Continuity Briefing~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob indoors prototype~
Desc     The final briefing concerns character continuity and recovery after death. In
this setting death can carry severe consequences, so make use of whatever
medical, backup or continuity services the wider game provides. Update those
safeguards regularly rather than waiting until after a major loss.

The briefing chamber uses ruggedized systems protected against radiation,
thermal swings and power interruptions, while a status display shows the
orbital position of Drakken Proxima Academy above Proxima Centauri b.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    51022
Flags     isdoor closed~
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    51017
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 51095 1 51027
Reset D 0 51027 0 1
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51099
Name     Drakken Academy Program Service Room~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob~Desc     This sealed service room exists for academy mobile programs and should not be
removed. Maintenance labels identify it as part of Drakken Proxima Academy's
internal automation network.
~

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51100
Name     Drakken Academy Test Workshop~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob factory~Desc     A small test workshop used by academy staff. Benches, diagnostic ports and
ruggedized systems protected against radiation, thermal swings and power
interruptions fill the room.
~

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51101
Name     Drakken Quiet Test Compartment~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob safe silence~Desc     A deliberately quiet compartment isolated from the busier academy modules.
deep red and neutral-white lamps chosen to remain clear during emergency
conditions and sound-damped surfaces make it suitable for testing or study.
~

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51129
Name     Drakken Isolated Test Chamber~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob prototype~Desc     This isolated test chamber is intentionally featureless. Instrument panels
from ruggedized systems protected against radiation, thermal swings and power
interruptions are the only obvious connection to the rest of Drakken Proxima
Academy.
~

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51130
Name     Drakken Student Commons~
Sector   inside~
Flags    nomob safe~
Desc     This is the academy student commons, a final safe place to rest, read and
practice using the message system. Use NOTE LIST to list messages, NOTE READ
<msgnum> to read one, and HELP NOTE for additional commands.

The room is a functional rest hall with heated seating and emergency gear
built into every wall. The station windows give occasional views of Proxima
Centauri b below and the fierce red primary beyond the shielded glass.
~
